5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Let's be pragmatic. I want to see how previous projects have actually aged before we trust new drawings.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. I'm worried about the actual construction phase and whether the local firms can deliver on time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I want to know about the money! Not just to build it, but what it costs to keep it pretty.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I'll be looking into the staffing. We need to know who is actually available to maintain the site.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I'm interested in how the land is actually used and the current state of the drainage.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, perhaps we should also check the earth-moving tenders to see if the risks are highlighted.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"That's a good point, Benjamin. I'll add that to my list.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, do you think the volunteer groups could help with the costs?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,It's possible. I will look into the volunteer groups as well.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I'll stick to the physical data. The weekday crossings should tell us a lot.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
