29,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
30,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems our history is mixed. Some water works held up, but surfacing and planting have been failures.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The ground is tricky. Clay and slippage are risks, and we can't easily close the main gate.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The funding is very restrictive. It only covers planting and water, not buildings or paving.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Our internal staff is depleted. We rely on contractors for specialist care and a casual pool for stewarding.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Minako,,"People are using the park as a thoroughfare to the tram, and the drainage is struggling.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, if the fund only covers water and planting, that narrows our options significantly.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minako, if the center is a high-traffic crossing, a complex layout might be problematic.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Mio,,Exactly. And the upkeep for planted areas is triple that of hard surfaces.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"We do have volunteers for habitat and sports, which is a silver lining.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Minako,,The heat readings are also high; we desperately need shade or water to cool the area.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, if we have sports volunteers, a sports-centric plan might be sustainable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Misaki,,But the earth-moving risks make large-scale reshaping dangerous and expensive.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Mio,,I'm worried about the long-term budget. Hard surfaces are cheaper to maintain.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Asuka,,But we can't fund hard surfaces with the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Minako,,We need a balance. Something that handles the water and the heat.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
